Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter}
Comment: 10,0:00:11.81,0:00:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.95,0:00:19.55,Thought,,0,0,0,,I just... I just can't stand it. {lit: I'm weak [to michael's toy]}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.55,0:00:20.55,Thought,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.55,0:00:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.32,0:00:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If only there was a fountain of genius\N from which ideas flowed without end...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd drink from that fountain until I drowned!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.03,0:00:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,True! If there was such a thing, \NI'd help myself to a drink too.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.17,0:00:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, laughing at me?! You've no idea what your owner has to go through!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.54,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Sensei, the deadline is just around the corner!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.28,0:00:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And Michael never meant to make fun of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.58,0:00:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Do you understand cat language? \NCan you understand the feelings of cats?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.89,0:00:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't mean it like that...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.90,0:01:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.\NWhat is Michael saying and thinking right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.27,0:01:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.37,0:01:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're living together in this small apartment, \Nand we don't even understand each other!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.92,0:01:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, this will cause\Neven more misunderstandings,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.54,0:01:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{eventually }leading to the collapse of the Kobayashi family, the ruin of humanity,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.78,0:01:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and the ultimate destruction of the Earth!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.95,0:01:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.52,0:01:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I must become a cat. Only then will we\Nbe able to connect our hearts and minds
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.13,0:01:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and save the Earth from destruction!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.01,0:01:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.85,0:02:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.94,0:02:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 10,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{Hmm?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.98,0:02:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.85,0:02:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Sensei, what about the deadline?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.12,0:02:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.12,0:02:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.39,0:02:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei! The deadline!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.98,0:02:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's at it again?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.94,0:03:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! What a cutie!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.80,0:03:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's almost unreal!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.83,0:03:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.38,0:03:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.47,0:03:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,At this stage, I'm already a cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.17,0:03:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A full-fledged cat, \Nso I can do anything a cat does! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.64,0:03:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Meowie...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.18,0:03:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You like it? {?? korokoro is "rolling" but we don't see him do it}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.38,0:03:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mraowr!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.85,0:03:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.98,0:03:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A pervert! {hentai is just any kind of freak}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.07,0:03:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Freak! {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.83,0:03:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that molester? \NThe cat man! {chikan}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.66,0:03:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he came from the Cat Planet!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, be careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.10,0:03:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You, have you seen the cat man?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.31,0:03:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.14,0:03:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.99,0:04:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Please, stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.82,0:04:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There! I found him!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.21,0:04:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.67,0:04:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.45,0:04:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.81,0:04:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop him!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.78,0:04:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.96,0:04:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a pervert chase.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.17,0:04:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.48,0:04:25.29,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.70,0:04:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.54,0:04:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh geez, this is getting difficult...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.82,0:04:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.71,0:05:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it...{Marty note: he's saying "Matte", not "mazui"}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.54,0:05:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No good.{maitta?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.11,0:05:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess he got away.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.78,0:05:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei, what on Earth happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.79,0:05:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Moral of the story: \Nhumans mustn't try to be cats.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.96,0:05:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow-ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.53,0:05:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in pain now. \NNo way I can do any more work today!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.83,0:05:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Sensei! Today is the deadline!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.92,0:05:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut me some slack.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.57,0:05:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not! Get to work!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.93,0:05:47.68,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.68,0:05:50.16,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.16,0:05:53.73,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.73,0:05:56.69,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one? {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.69,0:06:02.40,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one! \NWhat's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:06:03.91,0:06:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.64,0:06:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did my Poppo go?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.05,0:06:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the wind from the port \Nis piercing my heart coldly today.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.30,0:06:31.53,Song,,0,0,0,,A Stranger in the Starry Sky {étranger}{星空のエトランゼ from ep.2}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.03,0:06:36.00,Song,,0,0,0,,A silhouette that can't go home
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.00,0:06:39.17,Song,,0,0,0,,If you're a lost cat...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.03,0:06:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That voice...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.95,0:06:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Poppo!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.87,0:06:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.81,0:06:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking for you, Poppo!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.51,0:06:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you disappear from my life? {lit: from before me}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.08,0:06:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.75,0:06:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I just didn't want to cause trouble for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.26,0:06:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay now. \NWe've met again, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.15,0:06:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go now!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.65,0:07:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, I can't go.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You don't love me anymore?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.99,0:07:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No! It's not that.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.09,0:07:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl is bound by her debt!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.28,0:07:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Are you...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.33,0:07:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The owner of this bar, Catzilla. {nyajira}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.84,0:07:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.90,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're {\i1}the{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}Catzilla, the mastermind who runs this notorious port?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.44,0:07:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not taking Poppo anywhere \Nuntil her debt is paid off!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't have that kind of money...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.94,0:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, just forget about me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.25,0:07:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.88,0:07:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you'll take Poppo \Nby force if you have to?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.35,0:07:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.03,0:07:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael...!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.02,0:07:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's settle this outside.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.69,0:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight, fight... {/one-two}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.03,0:08:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! I don't want you to fight because of me!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.85,0:08:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.42,0:08:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Penalty warning. {lit: educational shido (minor penalty in judo) - think educ. here means "to warn you off, not to penalize you for the first offense"}{should we add a TL note that this is jugo sango from Juudou Bu Monogatari manga also by makoto kobayashi?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.33,0:08:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.50,0:08:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.54,0:08:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of bounds. {outside the hall (or stadium, market, etc.); off the grounds; off the premises; off-track​}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.71,0:08:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to the center!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.41,0:08:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.37,0:08:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Point! {yuko (judo)​ - probably means that the throw is scored and considered legal?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.60,0:08:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so disciplined! {lit: reliable - idk what she means}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.24,0:09:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold! {holding down (esp. in judo); holding technique; pinning down; immobilizing; bringing under control}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.99,0:09:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Broke free! {idk what to call it in judo lol}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.95,0:09:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to the center.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.41,0:09:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory! It's over! {ippon, stop there}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.11,0:09:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight, fight...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.25,0:09:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, I did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Poppo, now we can finally live together.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.39,0:09:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have someone I love.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.01,0:09:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Disciplined person, please wait! {reliable}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.40,0:10:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That disciplined person is now rigorously training for judo in the depths of this forest.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.51,0:10:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see his rigorous judo training!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.68,0:10:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight! {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.58,0:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. {yoshi?}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.78,0:10:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready! {???? no clue}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.58,0:10:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.22,0:10:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.04,0:10:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.19,0:10:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Start!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.79,0:10:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Point! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only training to be a referee?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.96,0:10:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Penalty.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.53,0:10:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.37,0:10:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his problem?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.50,0:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He made a total fool out of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.24,0:10:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a waste!
Comment: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.66,0:10:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.66,0:10:59.59,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Richard Kimbly. \NProfession: veterinarian. {I know he was Kimble in orphan's version but we clearly hear "kinburi" and "Kimberly" is the most common match, although could just be "Kimbly"}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.59,0:11:03.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,For the murder of his wife, a crime \Nhe did not commit, he was sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.06,0:11:06.95,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Thanks to a train accident during transport, \Nhe narrowly escaped.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.95,0:11:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kimbly!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.42,0:11:12.31,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Inspector Gerardly, the demon detective \Nwho'll stop at nothing
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.31,0:11:15.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,to put escaped death row inmate Richard Kimbly behind bars. {again, I can't just ignore that "ri" at the end; in manga they translated it as "Gerardly" so I think it fits along with kimbly}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.68,0:11:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the moment \NI've been waiting for, Kimbly. {ignoring -san since they have western names}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.35,0:11:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the chickens have finally come home to roost for you. {lit: it's time to pay your annual tax = to pay for your crimes}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.95,0:11:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.73,0:11:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.55,0:11:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Gerardly, I'm going to keep running until you haven't got a single hair on your head!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.68,0:11:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.49,0:12:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kimbly!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.58,0:12:15.80,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Thus, Kimbly safely tricked Gerardly \Nand escaped once again...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.80,0:12:16.37,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.37,0:12:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.48,0:12:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.48,0:12:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.21,0:12:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tongue is sticking out!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.42,0:12:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.33,0:12:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.30,0:12:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tongue is sticking out.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.69,0:12:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tongue is sticking out, \Nyou hear me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.21,0:12:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good boy and come out.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.63,0:12:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.77,0:12:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This cat's tongue is sticking out!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.57,0:12:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.96,0:12:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kimbly!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.06,0:12:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.02,0:13:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you. Your tongue's sticking out.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.49,0:13:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.79,0:13:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kimbly!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.80,0:13:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you need to put your tongue away. {pull in?}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.74,0:13:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you finally understand?
Comment: 10,0:13:23.37,0:13:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.69,0:13:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! That'll give you a hairball.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.87,0:13:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows a lack of brushing.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.66,0:13:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.71,0:13:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.08,0:13:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, be a good boy...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.42,0:13:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid. \NI'll clean you up nicely now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.03,0:13:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.50,0:13:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.66,0:13:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, don't you know \Nyou have to brush your cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.73,0:13:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you leave it, \Nthe cat will swallow a hairball.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.64,0:13:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?! \NI'm calling the police!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.34,0:14:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He has ear mites too! \NI must clean his ears.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The ears are the most common place \Nfor mites to infest.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know how to look after him?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.54,0:14:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I... uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.85,0:14:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, if you have cotton swabs \Nor gauze, bring them.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.52,0:14:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.56,0:14:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it, Michael? \NDon't you feel better already?
Comment: 10,0:14:18.84,0:14:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{Meow}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.29,0:14:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,His claws are too long.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.38,0:14:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's cut them neatly.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't offer anything better, but still...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.73,0:14:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at how happy Michael is now. {again, ignoring -kun}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.97,0:14:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My, you're right! \NHe's become so attached to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.67,0:14:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, you must make sure \Nto take good care of him regularly.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.16,0:14:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you very much for everything!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.61,0:14:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, before I leave, let me teach you \Nthe trick to catching a cat's tongue.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.15,0:14:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,First, spread butter on your thumb like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.49,0:14:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, come.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.66,0:14:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Isn't that easy?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.22,0:15:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, absolutely!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.14,0:15:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.00,0:15:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, Michael has a habit \Nof forgetting to put his tongue away.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.21,0:15:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the trouble to remind him, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.31,0:15:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go now.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.09,0:15:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.58,0:15:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the police! Please open up!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.47,0:15:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.02,0:15:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen this man recently?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.99,0:15:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That person just left.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.69,0:15:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.56,0:15:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.34,0:15:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... But what did he do?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.83,0:15:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an escaped death row convict!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.82,0:15:37.12,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The fugitive, Richard Kimbly.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.12,0:15:38.61,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Profession: veterinarian.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.61,0:15:40.28,Narrator,,0,0,0,,He can't afford any rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.28,0:15:43.08,Narrator,,0,0,0,,He lives on, today and tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.08,0:15:44.94,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Go, Richard Kimbly!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.94,0:15:47.48,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Richard Kimbly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:08.41,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{chapter}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.11,0:16:23.28,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Still overwhelmed, Kobayashi-san was struggling as usual with his enormous workload.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.89,0:16:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, I'm going to the bargain sale.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.43,0:16:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.57,0:16:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakamura-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.94,0:16:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we arrived here last night, you see,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.57,0:16:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so we thought we'd stop by \Nto see you two while we're here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.36,0:16:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, is that it?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.31,0:16:53.18,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The husband thought, \N"Just as I'm up to my eyeballs here." {they come with a visit}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.18,0:16:56.78,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The wife thought, "Just as I was going shopping for the first time in a while."
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.78,0:16:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, are you here for work?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.52,0:17:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm attending my relative's wedding.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.96,0:17:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.93,0:17:07.44,Narrator,,0,0,0,,For some reason, \Nthe conversation just didn't flow. {can't continue}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.70,0:17:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.66,0:17:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, isn't the weather nice today?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.10,0:17:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're right!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me bring you another cup!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Hey, can you manage it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.74,0:17:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.53,0:17:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm past the deadline already!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.20,0:17:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! He's your senpai, remember? {could mean that either of them is, or even both}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.64,0:17:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.97,0:17:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also blocked\Nfrom going to a bargain sale.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.10,0:17:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can't just ask them to leave, can we?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.61,0:17:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's worse, the conversation simply isn't going anywhere. {doesn't become lively}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.58,0:17:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.71,0:18:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If we talk about Michael, \Nit'll totally work out.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.16,0:18:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're right! \NI can go back to my work, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.72,0:18:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you here as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.88,0:18:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What, really? {yappari}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.43,0:18:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Michael, say hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.60,0:18:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My, isn't that cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.47,0:18:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{well...}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.54,0:18:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, we should leave soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.19,0:18:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd please excuse us...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.41,0:18:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.88,0:18:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Senpai.\NPlease feel free to come anytime.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.88,0:18:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You knucklehead! {klutz}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.98,0:18:53.77,Thought,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to come to this?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.77,0:18:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, look! \NMichael is washing his face!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.07,0:19:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, actually, you're right. He's washing it...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.47,0:19:00.77,Overlap,,0,0,0,,My! It's true...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.25,0:19:11.15,Thought,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me? {/what now/what is it}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.62,0:19:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, does it itch there?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.24,0:19:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What, just a fly?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.10,0:19:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare us like that, Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.72,0:19:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? I wonder where he's going.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.97,0:19:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.62,0:19:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, he was only going to the lavatory?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.15,0:19:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.42,0:19:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.25,0:19:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,See? If you call him, he always comes.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.49,0:19:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he a clever boy?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.64,0:19:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, look, a kitty teaser!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.78,0:20:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not in the mood... {/so unfriendly}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.27,0:20:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it's the fifth time already. {you've showed him the cat teaser}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.87,0:20:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.61,0:20:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, it's your food!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.64,0:20:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird, maybe he's not hungry? {doesn't want it}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.94,0:20:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You've fed him five times already, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.45,0:20:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.42,0:20:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, his pants should be dry by now.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.02,0:20:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's right!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfectly, absolutely, crispy and dry!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.00,0:20:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good... That means we can finally leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.74,0:20:36.24,Thought,,0,0,0,,Yippee! {hooray}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.24,0:20:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Senpai, please come again anytime.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.24,0:20:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we didn't have any entertainment...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.17,0:20:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}we're{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}sorry for imposing. {/to bother you}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.48,0:20:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.95,0:20:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.72,0:20:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, I'm in a fix...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.58,0:20:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like I won't be able \Nto go home for some time.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.87,0:21:18.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And as their hollow laughter echoed on, \Nthe night slowly wore away. {very poetry-like old-fashioned flowery line}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.98,0:21:21.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,
